# ─── Resume Generation Pipeline ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for: npm run generate (Claude AI resume generation)
# Not needed for: npm run dev, npm run build (website development)
# Get your key: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_key_here

# ─── GitHub CLI Authentication (optional) ───────────────────────────────────
# Required for: gh commands in WSL terminal (PR creation, branch protection)
# Not needed for: Claude Code (uses Windows gh.exe), CI, website development
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens → Fine-grained personal access tokens
# Scopes needed: Contents (read/write), Pull Requests (read/write)
# GH_TOKEN=github_pat_your_token_here
